<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Jakuk</para>
  <para style="toc1">JAKUKA Cayuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakuk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jak</para>
  <para style="mt1">JAKUKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cayuk</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jakuka cayuk</char> hin “khawmdek avan üng ngpyeng hükie Pamhnama khyangea” veia amhnüp tä ami kcünsak üng mcuhmthehnake ng’yuki ni. Cayuki naw msuimcäpnake jah sumei lü Khritjan mlungkaw ja vecawha tuilam ja pumngyam am sängeikia mcuhmthehnake jah sumeiki ni. Khritjan hmuhnak am mawngma khawhah bawimangnak ja mpyensetnak, hlawhlepnak, vecawh kdaw, thumcen, jumeinak ja ngneisak, ihawkba ngthumin vai, pumngyam, ngvawknak, camcahnak ja mlung mhnemnak, khyangkce ngthumkhyahnak, awhcahnak, mlung msaünak ja ktaiyünakea mawng yuki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ca naw aktunga a pyen ta Khritjan ningsaw üng ngneisak ja jumeinak am vecawha kyaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jumeinak ja Pumngyam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1:2-8</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mpyensetnak ja Bawimangnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">1:9-11</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Camnak ja hlawhlepnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:12-18">1:12-18</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngjaknak ja bilawhnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:19-27">1:19-27</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngkhawingpanaka phäh mcäinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jumeinak ja Bilawhnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khritjan ja a Mlei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khritjan ja Khawmdek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 4:1-5:6">4:1—5:6</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mcuhmthehnak mjüküme <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5:7-20</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mt 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mk 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:13">Ngs 15:13</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:19">Kal 1:19</ref></char>
    </note> Bawi Jesuh Khritaw ja Pamhnama mpya Jakuk üngkhyüh ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Khawmdek avan üng ngpyeng hükie Pamhnama khyang avan ning jah hnukset veng.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumeinak ja Pumngyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Ka püie, nami cehnak üng akhak mjüküm a lawpha üng na kam dawki tia namimät ngaiei u, <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>akhake cun nami jumeinak naw a näng üng nami yah vai ta cuneinak khawh ni tia nami ksingki. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Nami cuneinak naw käh nami ngtawngpäkia aning jah cehpüi üng nami hlükaw käh ve lü kümcei lü nami bebang khai ni tia ngsingsak ua. <verse eid="JAS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Pumngyam am na tak üng nang üng ning pe khawhkia Pamhnama vei na ktaiyü vai, isetiakyaküng, Pamhnam naw käh kpamei lü bäbangnak am avan üng jah peki ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Lüpi na ktaiyü üng käh uplat lü jumnak am ktaiyüa. Uplatkia khyang cun khawkhi naw hmut lü ngnawk hüki mpanglai üng tängki ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7-8"/>Acukba na ve ta, na pawhmsah naküt üng na mlung käh nängei lü am sikhyakia na ve khai ni. Bawipaa vei na ktaiyü na yah khaia pi käh ngai kawm pi.<verse eid="JAS 1:7-8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpyenkse ja Bawimang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Mpyenksekiea Khritjane cän Pamhnam naw a jah jähsawn üng je u lü, <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10,11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6">Hesa 40:6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 40:7">7</ref> (LXX)</char></note> bawimangkiea Khritjane cän Pamhnam naw a jah msumnemsak üng je u se. Bawimangnak cun mawa veki khyäipaia kba khyükleih khai ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Khawnghngi lut law se ngling lü a dung cun ui law lü, a pai pi kyü khai, a ngtonak pi pyak khai ni. Bawimang he pi kunpan khaia ami ceh üng acukba kunga pyakmsai khaie ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Camnak ja Hlawhlepnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Khuikha sawng üng sitih lü vekie cän je u se, isetiakyaküng, amimi naw camnak cun ami khe khawh üng Pamhnam kphyanakie üng khyütam a jah peta xünnaka ngkhyengnak yah khaie ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Acuna khuikhanake naw a jah hlawhlep üngta, “Ahin cun Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawkia hlawhlepnak ni” käh mi ti vai u. Pamhnam cun akse naw am hlawhlep thei, amät naw u pi akse am hlawhlep. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Lüpi mimäta hlükaweie akse naw jah man lü a jah kaiha kcün üng ni hlawhlepnak mi khamei. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Mi hlükawei akse naw mpyai lü mkhyenak a canak ni, mkhyenak cun däm law lü thihnak a canak law ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Ka püie, u naw pi käh ning jah mhleimhlak kawm! <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Akdaw naküt teyet ja kümkia bänak hin khankhaw üngkhyüh lawki. Am ngthunghlai, am jah nghlata lü anghmüp pi am vesak, acun käna khankhaw akvaie pi jah Mhnünmcengki Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawki ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Amäta ngjak'hlüa ngthungtak üngkhyüh a jah xün lawsaka kyase, a mhnünmceng nakütea ksunga akcüka hnün mi yahkie ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngjaknak ja Bilawhnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Ka püie, hin hin süm ua! Avan cän ngjaknak üng jang lü pyensaknak ja mlungsonak üng cü yah khai ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Nghngicima mlungsonak naw ngsungpyunkia Pamhnama nümnak cun am yah thei. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Acuna kyase, akse vecawh ja mtüihkse naküt cun jah lola ua. Pamhnama vei ngcuapei lü ning jah küikyan khawhkia ngthu nami mlunga a tak cän dokhamei ua.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Ngjaknak sawxat üng namät käh mhlei lü acun cän ngneisak na a. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Ngthu cän ngja sawxatki lü am na ngneisaknak üngta hman üng amimät bükki khyange am ni na täng kawm. <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>Amimät hman am bük u lü ami ceh hü üngta ia mäi lawki he ti cun am süm be ti u. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Khyang jah mhlät lü kümceikia thum cän k’et lü bük ua, acun cän bük kyet ua, käh mhnih lü käh ngai sawxat u lüpi nami ngneisaknak üngta nami bilawhnaka khana Pamhnam naw dawkyanak ning jah pe khai ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Ka ningsaw mahki ti lü mat mat naw ngaiki aw. Lüpi na mlei am na mkhüp khawh üngta na ningsawnak ia am kya lü na mlung na mhleieikia ni a kya ta. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Mi Pa Pamhnam naw ngcim lü kcangkia a ngaiha ningsaw ta: ngakyahe ja hmeinue khuikha lü ami ve üng jah mcei lü amimät pi khawmdek naw käh a jah kcimkpyehsak vaia mcei vai cän ni.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ngkhawingpanak mcäinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Ka püie, hlüngtaikia Bawi, mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw nami jumkia kya lü khyange a khawkpunga ami ngsuingsak cän bük lü käh jah mkhawimhnga ua. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Bawimangki naw xüi kutcüp ja suisak kdaw suisa lü mpyenkse naw kpyawn suisa lü nami ngkhämnaka ami law vai cän ngai süm ua. <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Suisak kdaw suisaki cän leisawng lü “khung akdaw üng ngawa” ti lü mpyenkse üngta “cäa ngdüia am ani üng ka khaw kung imcia ngawa, <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>acukba anita nami ksunga ngkhawingpanak namät naw pawh uki lü nami ngaihtüh aksea khana tünei lü ngthumkhyahnak nami pawhkie ni.<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Ka püie na ngai u! Pamhnam naw hin khawmdeka mpyenksee cän jah xü lü jumeinak üng bawimang u lü ani kphyanakia phäh khyütam a jah peta pe cän ka na khaie ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Nang, mpyenkse am na leisawngki ni! Acune ta nang naw jah mkhuhmhlihki lü ngthumkhyah mkhawngea veia na jah kaihe cän ni. Bawimang he ta ue ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Nang üng ning peta ngming kdaw cän aksea pyenki cun bawimange ni.<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cangcim üng vekia, “Na im pei lo ceng cän namät na kphyanaka kba jah kphya naa” tia Khyawngpea thum cän na läklam üngta akcang ni nang naw na bilawh kawm. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Lüpi khyange akpung da ami ngsuingsak jah bük lü na ve üngta, nang cun mkhyekatnak pawhki lü thum na lümkanki tia Thum naw ni mkatei khai ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Thum mat lümkan nakütki naw avan a lümkana kyaki ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: a</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Ex 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Deut 5:18</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ex 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Deut 5:17</ref></char></note>Mat üng a pyen ta, “Khyanga khyuca käh bäühmanak vai,” a ti be tü ta, “Khyang käh hnima,” a ti ni. Khyanga khyuca am na bäünak üngpi khyang na hnim üngta thum na lümkankia kyaki ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Ngthumkhyah law üng thum naw a jah mhlät vai khyangea kba, vecawh jah pyensak ngsungkia ve ua. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Mpyeneinak am takia khyang cun ngthumkhyah law üng Pamhnam naw am mpyenei; lüpi mpyeneinak naw ngthumkhyahnak cun näng ve.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumeinak ja Ngneisak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Ka püie, nangmi üngka mat naw jumeinak ka taki ti lü pyen se, am a ngneisaknak üngta ia ngmangnak khai ni. Acuna jumeinak naw ning küikyan thei khai aw. <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Na benae ja cinae naw ami suisak vai ja ei vai am ami tak vai cun ngai süma. <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>Ami phäha hlüki am jah pe xa lü, “Ak'üpawma ngsuingsa lü akhlima eiawa! Pamhnam naw dawnak ning pe se na ti cän ia pi am dawkya na khaie ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Acukba kyase, jumeinak amät ve lü ngneisak am a ngpüi üngta acun hin akthi ni.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Lüpi khyang mat naw, “Mat naw jumeinak ta ve, akce naw ngneisak kdaw ta ve,” a ti üng. “Ngneisak am ngpüi xa lü na jumeinak na mdana. Kei naw ka jumeinak cun ngneisak am ka mdan khai,” ti lü ka msang khai ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Pamhnam mat däk veki tia na jumki aw. Daw ve! Khawyaie naw pi kyüheinak am ngkhet u lü jum ve u. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Khyang nghmawng aw! Ngneisak am ngpüi xakia jumeinak hin am mdang ni ti cun na ksing hlüki aw.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ia amkyah, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknak üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">akthi, tia veki.</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Gen 22:1-14</ref></char></note>Mi pupa Abraham cän ihawkba ni Pamhnam üng a ngsungpyun ta. A ca Isak ngkengnaka khana ta lü ngneisak üng a mdana phäha ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Am na hmu theiki aw. A jumeinak ja a vecawh atänga ngbilo ni lü a jumeinak cän a vecawha phäh kümceikia kyaki ni. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Gen 15:6</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:7">2Khro 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">Hesa 41:8</ref></char></note>Cangcim cang lü, “Abraham naw Pamhnam jumki, acuna a jumeinak cun Pamhnam naw ngsungpyunkia dokhamei petki ni,” ti lü pyenki. Acunakyase, Abraham cun Pamhnama püia ngsui lawki. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Büka, mi ngneisaka phäh Pamhnam am mi ngsungpyun law be lü mi jumeinak amät däka am kya ve.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Jos 2:1-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nghnumi kse Rahap üng ahin cun täng ve. Ani naw Isarel msäke jah dokham lü lam kce üng ami lät vaia a jah kueia phäh ani cun a ngneisaka phäh Pamhnam üng ngsungpyunnak yahki ni.<verse eid="JAS 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Pumsa cun Ngmüimkhya kaa akthia mäi ni, acuna kba vecawh am ngpüikia jumeinak cun akthi hnga ni.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Mlei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Ka püie, nami van cun jah mtheikia saja am thawn uki. Nami ksinga kba jah mtheikie sajae cun akcea kthak däm bawkia ngthumkhyahnak angkata khamei khaie ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Avan naw mi hma theiki. A pyennak üng hmanak am pawh khawi tikia khyang cän kümcei lü a pumsa avan nängeiki ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Ngsea mpyawng cän kbüpnak üng mi kbüp lü jah kcangnak khaia mi pawh lü mi hlüeinaka mi cehpüi khawhki. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Mlawngnu cän ngai süm u: däm kyaw lüpi khawkhi naw a ceh hü ni, ani cun mawngnak akdik am ktui lü mawngki naw a hlünaka a mawng ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Mlei pi acuna täng ni: dik ca kyaw lüpi akdäm kdäma awhcah theiki ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Ia mäi dämkia maw cän pi mei ksa api naw avana uiki ti cän ngai süma! <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Mlei cun meia mäi ni. Hmanaka mdeka pi kya lü mi pumsa üng ve lü akse cun mi pumsa naküt üng kpha hüki ni. Mi pumsa avan cun pi mulai üngkhyüh lawkia mei naw avana uiki ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Mimi khyange cun naw khisa k’länge ja kphyukhae, ngnawnngvakie ja ngae cun jah näng vai kunga mi jah nängei khawhkie ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Lüpi u naw pi mlei cun am näng khawh. Mlei cun am mi kbüp khawha aksexu kya lü thihnak vai asik am beki ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Gen 1:26</ref></char></note>Mi mlei cun Bawipa ja Pamhnam mhlünmtainaka pi sumei lü Pamhnama mäia mhnünmcenga kyaki khyange pi mi jah yüncenak ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Mpyawng mat üngkhyüh jenak khyü ja yüncenak khyü lut lawki ni. Ka püie, ahikba am thawn yah. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Tui hna mat üngkhyüh aktui ja akha tui cun am lawng law thei. <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Ka püie, kthei dung cun olipa am ngthei, capyit pi ktheia am ngthei, acuna kba sih naw tui kdaw am mhluh law.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khana ka pumngyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Nangmi üng kthem lü ksingkhyapki nami veki aw. Akdawa na xünsak üng mdanki lü akdaw na bilawh cun mlung mhnemnak ja pumngyam am pawhmsah a. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Lüpi na mlung k'uma ng’eihnak, ksekhanak, kamvanak ja ngthungtak cän käh mkhye na lü nami pumngyam käh awhcah ua. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Acu banga pumngyam cun khankhaw üngkhyüh am law: khawmdek üng am sängei lü mtisa, ngmüimkhyakse ja khawkse pumngyam üng sängeiki ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Ng’eihnak ja kamvanak ami venaka am cunginak ja aksexu naküt pi veki. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Khan üngkhyüh lawkia pumngyam cun akcük säiha ngcim lü ani cun dim’yenak, hniphnawinak ja nglawieinak: ani cun mpyenmseinak am be lü akdawkyaa bilawhnak cun mawihahnak be pawhki ni. Ani cun limmanak ja am cuhliheinak am ve. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Dimdeihnak pawhkia nglin, dimdeihnaka mci üngkhyüh akdawkya bilawhnak cun mawihaheinak be pawhki ni.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Khawmdeka dä nglawieinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Hawn üngkhyüh ni ngtunnak ja ngvawknak naküt hin nangmi üngkhyüh a law ta. Nangmi üng angläta ngtunnak hin mlümlawknak ja nami hlükaweinak üngkhyüh lawki he ni. <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Nami hlüei am nami taeikia kyase khyang nami hnimki. Akdena nami hlüei am nami yaheikia kyase ngtun ngvawk nami pawhkie. Nami hlüei am nami yah khawh hin acuna phäh Pamhnam am nami kthäha phäh ni. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Nami ktaiyü üngpi am yah uki, isetiakyaküng, nami cungaih se lü nami mäta mlümlawknaka na sumei vaia nami kthäha phäh ni. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Am sitihkia khyange! Khawmdek püiei hlünaki hin Pamhnama ye ni tia am nami ksingki aw. Khawmdeka püia nami thawn hlü üngta Pamhnama yea namimät nami thawnsaki ni. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Cangcim üng ngthungtak am ve tia käh ngaia, “Pamhnam naw a jah tak peta Ngmüimkhya cun naw akdena hlükaweinak am beki ni,” tia pyenki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya; akdena hlükaweinake; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mi k'uma Ngmüimkhya a taka phäh Pamhnam äheiki</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Ngthk 3:34</ref> (LXX) </char></note>Lüpi Pamhnam naw a jah peta bäkhäknak hin kthamah bawki ni. Cangcim naw, “Camcahki Pamhnam naw jah mah lü mlung mhnemkie üng bäkhäknak jah peki ni.<verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Acuna kyase, namimät Pamhnam üng cuapa. Khawyai cän nami mah üng nang ning dawn ta khai ni. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Pamhnama vei nami cäh üng ani cun pi nami veia cäh law khai ni. Nangmi mkhyeki he, nami kut mthi ua! Limmakie nami mlung ngcimsak ua! <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Pukse u, ngpyang lü kyap u: nami yaihnak cän kyahnaka nglatsak lü nami jenak pi helatnaka nglatsak ua! <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Bawipa maa mlung nami mhnem üng ani naw ning jah jäksawn khai ni.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritjan akce ngthumkhyah pet mcäinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Ka püie, khyangkce käh khinyaiei u. Nang naw Khritjan kce khinyaiei lü ngthu nami khyah üngta nangmi naw Thum cän ngthumkhyah lü nami khinyaieikie ni. Thum cän ngthu nami mkhyah üng Thum cän nami läklamkia am kya lü Thum ngthumkhyahkia ni nami kya ve. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Pamhnam däk ni Thum jah pe lü ngthumkhyahkia a kya ve. Ani naw jah küikyan lü jah mkhyüh khawhki ni. Khyangkce ngthumkhyah pet khai ta namimät ia nami ngaieikie ni.<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Awhcahnaka mawng mcäinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13,14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 27:1">Ngthk 27:1</ref> </char>
    </note> “Tuhngawi am ani üng khawngawi mlüh mata cit lü kum mat bang ve vai lü kunpan pawh lü ngui khawhah mi sui vai u,” tikie naw tuha na ngai ua. <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Khawngawi nami sak ia thawn khai ti cun am ksing uki! Nangmi cun asäng po law lü khyük bekia mei khua mäi ni a law ta. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>“Bawipa naw hlüei lü mi xün u ta cun mi pawh kawm u” ti lü nami pyen vaia ni a kya ve. <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Lüpi atuha camcah lü nami awhcahki, awhcahnak avan cun khyeki ni.<verse eid="JAS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Acuna kyase, akdaw pawh vai ksing lü am mi pawh cän mi pawh vai u, mimi cun mi mkhyeki hea kyaki ni.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Bawimang he jah mcäinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Bawimang he atuh na ngai ua! Nami khana pha law khai kyühksea phäh ngpyang lü kyap ua! <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2,3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:19">Mt 6:19</ref></char></note> Nami bawimangnak cän thu uih u lü nami suisake pi mkhya naw jah cawn ve. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Nami ngui xüie pi mthiek kai lü acun hin saksia kya lü meia kba nami pumsa eiawki ti cun mdanki ni. Nangmi naw akpäihnaka mhnüpe üng khawhthem nami jah mkhämkie ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:14-15">Deut 24:14-15</ref></char></note> Nami loa khüikie cän ami ngkhyeng am jah pe uki. Ami pyensak cän jah ngaih pe ua! Nami tuncang kbämkiea ngpyang kthai cun Bawipa Kdäm Säih Pamhnama nghnga pha vaiki ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Khawmdeka nami xünsak cän mlümlawknak ja xenak am beki ni. Yawhtihnaka mhnüpa kba nami mlung nami phubesakie ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Am mkhye am vekia khyange cän naw am ami jah mkhyawha kya lü jah mkatei lü nami jah hnim u ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyange naw am ning jah mah u; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyange. Pamhnam naw ning mah khai aw </char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mlung msaünak ja ktaiyünak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Ka püie, Bawipa a law veia nami mlung msaü ua. Lai kbie cän naw, ihlawka ami lai üngka tuncang k'äiheikie ti cän jah bükteng ua. Kphyawi khaw ah ja acuna hnua ah law khai khaw ah vai cun ami mlungmsaü lü k'äiheikie ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Nangmi pi nami mlungmsaü ua. Nami äpeinak cän mhlün ua, isetiakyaküng, Bawipaa a lawnak be vai mhnüp cän cäh lawkia kyase ni.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Ka püie, Pamhnam naw ngthu käh a ning jah mkhyah vai mat ja mat käh ngkhyaei ua. Ngthumkhyah khai cun cäh lü po law hlühnühki ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Ka püie, Bawipaa ngming pyenkie sahmae cän jah süm ua. Khuikha ami sawng üng mlungmsaü lü ami cunei cän jah ngcuhngkih na ua. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Job 1:21</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 1:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:10">2:10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 103:8">Sal 103:8</ref></char></note>Amimi jekie mi jah tinak, isetiakyaküng, ami cuneia phäh ni. Jawpaa mlungmsaü cän mi ngja pängkie. Akpäihnaka ania phäh Bawipa naw ihawkba a petmsawt ti cun nami ksingki. Bawipa cun Mpyeneinak ja hniphnawinak am beki ni.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:34-37">Mt 5:34-37</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka püie, acun käna khyütam nami pawh üng käh ng'yünce ua. Khankhaw ja khawmdek ja akce pyen lüpi käh ng'yünce ua. “Ä” vai cän ä lü “Kaa” vai cän kaa nami ti üng Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnaka kea am pha uki.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Akhak sawngki nangmi üng veki aw. Ktaiyü u se. Jekyaiki ta nangmi üng veki aw. Mhlünmtainak ng’äi mcuk u se. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:13">Mk 6:13</ref></char></note> Am myaki nangmi üng veki aw. Sangcim ngvaie jah khü u lü Bawipaa ngming am olip si jut lü ktaiyü pet khaie ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Jumeinak am ktaiyünak naw am myaki mdaw be lü; Bawipa naw jah mdaw be lü, mkhye ami pawh pi jah mhlät pet khai ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Nami mya be vaia nami mkhye mat ja mat phyeh lü mat ja mat ktaiyü pet ua. Khyang kdawa ktaiyünak cun johitmahki ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Sang 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:1">18:1</ref></char></note>Elijah cun mimia kba nghngicim ni. Khaw käh ah law khaia ktaiyü lü khawmdeka kum kthum ja khya khyuk khaw am ah law. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:42-45">1Sang 18:42-45</ref></char></note>Ktaiyü be tü se khankhaw üngkhyüh khaw ah law be lü khawmdeka tuncange daw law beki.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Ka püie, nangmi üngka mat mat ngthungtak üngkhyüh akthuka a pha üng mat mat naw law püi be ua, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Ngthk 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:8">1Pit 4:8</ref></char></note>hin süm ua: Mkhyekia khyang lam a hmenak üngkhyüh nglat law besaki naw mkhyekia Ngmüimkhya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mkhyekia Ngmüimkhya cän; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">amäta Ngmüimkhya. </char></note> cän thihnak üngkhyüh küikyan lü mkhyenak khawhah mhläteinaka mawng pi law püiki ni.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
